# Mutations

# Mutations
genetics.mutations.Bloodfang.name = Bloodfang
genetics.mutations.Bloodfang.desc = Your hits heal you for 8% of the damage dealt, 15% at night.
genetics.mutations.BrawlersRush.name = Brawler's Rush
genetics.mutations.BrawlersRush.desc = Each melee hit within 3 s of the last adds +5% damage, up to +25%. Getting hit resets it.
genetics.mutations.Pounce.name = Pounce
genetics.mutations.Pounce.desc = Your first melee hit while in the air after a sprint deals +50% and slows the target.
genetics.mutations.VenomGlands.name = Venom Glands
genetics.mutations.VenomGlands.desc = Every 4th hit on the same target poisons it.
genetics.mutations.Webspinner.name = Webspinner
genetics.mutations.Webspinner.desc = Hits have a 15% chance to root the target for 1.5 s.
genetics.mutations.EmberHeart.name = Ember Heart
genetics.mutations.EmberHeart.desc = Below 50% health your hits set targets on fire, and fire can't hurt you.
genetics.mutations.Frostbite.name = Frostbite
genetics.mutations.Frostbite.desc = Melee attackers are slowed; a third hit within 6 s freezes them for 2 s.
genetics.mutations.Overpressure.name = Overpressure
genetics.mutations.Overpressure.desc = Each hit you take builds pressure. At 5, your next attack releases a shockwave that throws nearby enemies back.
genetics.mutations.Overpressure.trigger = Pressure released!
genetics.mutations.ApexRoar.name = Apex Roar
genetics.mutations.ApexRoar.desc = On a kill, nearby enemies are slowed and deal 20% less damage for 5 s.
genetics.mutations.ApexRoar.trigger = Your roar cows the creatures around you.
genetics.mutations.VoidSiphon.name = Void Siphon
genetics.mutations.VoidSiphon.desc = A kill restores 20% Mana (40% against Void creatures) and multiplies your max Mana by 1.2 for 10 s.
genetics.mutations.BloodInTheWater.name = Blood in the Water
genetics.mutations.BloodInTheWater.desc = While swimming, hits on targets below 50% health deal +30% and give you Speed for 4 s.
genetics.mutations.Scavenger.name = Scavenger
genetics.mutations.Scavenger.desc = Kills have a 10% chance to drop the victim's loot a second time.
genetics.mutations.GrizzlyFury.name = Grizzly Fury
genetics.mutations.GrizzlyFury.desc = Below 40% health: your max Health is multiplied by 1.15 (on top of your Health genes) and you deal 10% more damage.
genetics.mutations.GrizzlyFury.trigger = Fury takes over!
genetics.mutations.Undying.name = Undying
genetics.mutations.Undying.desc = A killing blow leaves you at 1 health with 3 s of immunity. Once every 10 minutes.
genetics.mutations.Undying.trigger = You refuse to die!
genetics.mutations.Blink.name = Blink
genetics.mutations.Blink.desc = When one hit takes more than 20% of your health, you dash away from the attacker.
genetics.mutations.ColdBlooded.name = Cold Blooded
genetics.mutations.ColdBlooded.desc = When slowed or frozen, the effect is removed at once and you gain Might for 6 s.
genetics.mutations.MagmaBlood.name = Magma Blood
genetics.mutations.MagmaBlood.desc = Taking fire damage makes you immune to fire and regenerates you for 6 s.
genetics.mutations.Bulwark.name = Bulwark
genetics.mutations.Bulwark.desc = Crouch still for 1 s to brace: less physical damage and no knockback until you move.
genetics.mutations.Featherfall.name = Featherfall
genetics.mutations.Featherfall.desc = Falling more than 6 blocks slows your fall and cancels fall damage.
genetics.mutations.SpringLegs.name = Spring Legs
genetics.mutations.SpringLegs.desc = Crouch for 1 s, then jump: a much higher leap, and Speed for 4 s.
genetics.mutations.Photosynthesis.name = Photosynthesis
genetics.mutations.Photosynthesis.desc = Stand still in daylight for 3 s: Health and Stamina regenerate until you move.
genetics.mutations.EggLayer.name = Egg Layer
genetics.mutations.EggLayer.desc = Crouch for 5 s to lay an egg. Once every 10 minutes.
genetics.mutations.EggLayer.trigger = You lay an egg.
genetics.mutations.SilentHunter.name = Silent Hunter
genetics.mutations.SilentHunter.desc = At night, hits on enemies that aren't targeting you deal +50%.
genetics.mutations.AdrenalSurge.name = Adrenal Surge
genetics.mutations.AdrenalSurge.desc = Dropping below 30% health gives you a burst of Speed for 8 s.
genetics.mutations.AdrenalSurge.trigger = Adrenaline floods your veins!
genetics.effects.GrizzlyFury.name = Grizzly Fury
genetics.effects.VoidSiphon.name = Void Siphon
genetics.effects.Cowed.name = Cowed
genetics.effects.Bulwark.name = Braced

# What each buff does (shown in the Catalogue)
genetics.effects.Speed.desc = Move 20% faster.
genetics.effects.Speed_T2.desc = Move 30% faster.
genetics.effects.Speed_T3.desc = Move 40% faster.
genetics.effects.NightVision.desc = See in the dark.
genetics.effects.Regen_T1.desc = Regenerates 1% of your max Health every 2 s.
genetics.effects.Regen_T2.desc = Regenerates 1.5% of your max Health every 2 s.
genetics.effects.Regen_T3.desc = Regenerates 2% of your max Health every 2 s.
genetics.effects.Vitality_T1.desc = Max Health x1.05.
genetics.effects.Vitality_T2.desc = Max Health x1.10.
genetics.effects.Vitality_T3.desc = Max Health x1.15, and 5% less physical and projectile damage taken.
genetics.effects.Endurance_T1.desc = Max Stamina x1.10.
genetics.effects.Endurance_T2.desc = Max Stamina x1.20, and Stamina regenerates a little.
genetics.effects.Endurance_T3.desc = Max Stamina x1.30, and Stamina regenerates faster.
genetics.effects.Stamina_Regen.desc = Stamina regenerates over time.
genetics.effects.Fall_Immunity.desc = No fall damage.
genetics.effects.Fire_Immunity.desc = Immune to fire damage.
genetics.effects.Freeze_Immunity.desc = Can't be frozen.
genetics.effects.Poison_Immunity.desc = Immune to poison damage.
genetics.effects.Environmental_Immunity.desc = Immune to environmental damage.
genetics.effects.Might_T1.desc = Deal 10% more physical and projectile damage.
genetics.effects.Might_T2.desc = Deal 20% more physical and projectile damage.
genetics.effects.Might_T3.desc = Deal 30% more physical and projectile damage.
genetics.effects.Hide_T1.desc = Take 8% less physical and projectile damage.
genetics.effects.Hide_T2.desc = Take 15% less physical and projectile damage.
